lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304480/extras/d5e5d7ee2ee8de69a6c894723e3b5a9c.poster.avif?t=1751032266\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304480/extras/d5e5d7ee2ee8de69a6c894723e3b5a9c.webm?t=1751032266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304480/extras/d5e5d7ee2ee8de69a6c894723e3b5a9c.mp4?t=1751032266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PLAY SOLO OR WITH A CREW</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on contracts alone or with up to <strong>10 players</strong> in chaotic co-op action. Team up, combine abilities, and adapt to the ever-changing threats of each dimension. Choose from four distinct characters: <strong>Jack</strong>, the Scarecrow Bandit, a trickster with deadly precision; <strong>Roxan</strong>, the Time-Warped Mercenary, wielding futuristic tech; <strong>Roth</strong>, the Demigod, a force of raw destruction; and <strong>Bob</strong>, the Military Mechanic, a master of gadgets and heavy firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304480/extras/f9ddff3f8874f9d046ecc3025f564719.avif?t=1751032266\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Elite Rogue \u2013 BOUNTIES. CHAOS. BETRAYAL. Every contract is a high-stakes gamble in this unpredictable roguelike! Hunt alone or with up to 10 players, earn Darkmatter to unlock game-breaking powers, manipulate reality, and outsmart rivals. Adapt or be erased. WISHLIST NOW!",
